<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:30:05 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>西班牙德科斯将接替拉加德担任欧洲央行行长（视频）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/spain-s-de-cos-set-to-succeed-lagarde-as-ecb-president-video-mwxmko5n</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/spain-s-de-cos-set-to-succeed-lagarde-as-ecb-president-video-mwxmko5n'&gt;西班牙德科斯将接替拉加德担任欧洲央行行长（视频）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Spain's De Cos Set to Succeed Lagarde as ECB President&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/spain-s-de-cos-set-to-succeed-lagarde-as-ecb-president-video-mwxmko5n</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:05:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>¿Qué causó las Fallas tecnológicas en EE.UU.？</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/-que-causo-las-fallas-tecnologicas-en-ee-uu-video</li